<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AK12 macro for fuze/ace</Major>
    <Description>Good recoil, a bit of fluctuation for discreteness, so don't try to empty a mag into a pixel.

Loadout: Acog, vert, comp

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 29 1 30
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 39
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 34
Delay 20 ms
MoveR -10 29
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>